reast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">제출자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">논문과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">수료학기 및 수료학점을 갖춘자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">논문연구학점 이수자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, (2023</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">년 이전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">졸업종합시험 합격자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">/(2024</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">년 이후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">논문연구계획서 구술시험 합격자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, (2015</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">년도 입